ii. Petitioners - accused Nos.1, 2 and 3 in Crl.P. No.201423/2024 and the petitioner - accused No.5 in Crl.P. No.201424/2024 are granted anticipatory bail in the event of their arrest in Crime No.36/2024 registered by Roza Polie Station, Kalaburagi pending on the file of I Addl. Chief Judicial Magistrate, Kalaburagi, subject to following conditions:
i) Petitioners - accused Nos.1, 2 and 3 in Crl.P.No.201423/2024 and the petitioner - accused No.5 in Crl.P. No.201424/2024 shall execute personal bond in a sum of Rs.2,00,000/-
(Rupees Two Lakhs only) each with two sureties each for likesum to the satisfaction of the Trial Court;
(b) They shall not tamper with the prosecution witnesses directly or indirectly;
NC: 2024:KHC-K:9603 (c) They shall not indulge themselves in similar offences strictly;
(d) They shall not leave the jurisdiction of this Court without prior permission.

opennyai_summary.decision:
One of the accused is already granted anticipatory bail by this Court.
When such being the case, the petitioners are not required for custodial interrogation in order to reject the anticipatory bail and the offences are not punishable either with death or imprisonment for life.
Crl.P. Nos.201423/2024 and 201424/2024 are allowed.
